      "id": "claim_eb96a970568c4b779448329629560c2c",
      "statement": "The active RAG runtime is a LangGraph StateGraph; build_graph() supplies the public graph with constrained GraphInput/GraphOutput, GraphEngine compiles and executes it for the CLI and other in-process callers, and the LangGraph server separately exports the compiled healthcare_rag graph from healthcare_rag/graph/__init__.py, with langgraph.json also registering a distinct coach graph.",
