    {
      "id": "claim_ca8f6936c9224ccd83307ea43740d784",
      "statement": "Decision nodes (safety_gate, generate_query_or_respond, decompose_query, merge_retrievals, evaluate_retrieval) own their own transitions by returning Command with a typed goto computed from their post-update state; ordinary sequencing is declared as plain edges in build.py, while validate_answer alone uses a conditional edge because its 'finalize' target differs between the public graph (finalize) and the internal pipeline (END).",
