    {
      "id": "claim_4588b1f5cb0649a9959ecaaa3da1c661",
      "statement": "finalize renders refusals with notices, preserves direct answers, or renders a validated answer with notices, scrubbing answer and follow-ups again at this output boundary, and appends a scrubbed Human/AI message pair to checkpoint history with a shared ISO-8601 timestamp only when the rendered answer string is nonempty (the update's messages key is set only inside an 'if answer:' guard), so a turn producing an empty answer leaves that turn's checkpoint history untouched.",
