    {
      "id": "claim_1873dc378798408c835c5e0954f53f95",
      "statement": "Each retrieval Send scrubs its query, uses fail-soft tool routing (aroute_tools) to select collection queries, then dispatches the configured retrieval arm (weaviate/hybrid_search, pageindex/pageindex_search, or pinecone/pinecone_search), with a resource-injected hybrid_search override always taking precedence; Weaviate and Pinecone transient SDK errors are retried up to three times with one- then two-second delays, and a terminal failure produces an empty envelope so other fan-out branches survive.",
      "evidence": [
